@@ -0,0 +1,132 @@
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
+/* Look-up table query interface for the rtl8365mb switch family
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2022 Alvin Šipraga <alsi@bang-olufsen.dk>
